  ('Kangan at the Westin, 18th floor', 'Northwest-frontier Indian with floor-to-ceiling city views. Dinner 7 to 11:30 pm. The one for an anniversary, or when you want to impress. Good for talking. Veg and non-veg, bar.', 5000, 'Goregaon East', 'Kangan, The Westin Mumbai Garden City', 19.1706, 72.8598, 'romantic,foodie', 'low', 'mon-sun 19:00-23:30', 'evening', 120, 'always', 1, 'indoor', '', NULL),
